# Allow-list build context: ignore everything, then re-include what the
# image needs. Keeps tests, specs, caches, secrets and VCS data out of layers.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!deploy/gunicorn.conf.py
!data/sample/

# Never ship bytecode or caches that slipped into re-included paths.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
